        {
          "id": "the-system-drawn-from-source--text-0-p-53",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Coverage on both benchmarks (Table II). Time overhead stays under 200% of single-language LSIF indexers: from −47.97% (TypeScript) to +104.72% (C++) on the benchmarks, +175.73% on grpc (934,936 lines) and +22.68% on grpc-go (Table III). Peak memory falls by 70.93% on grpc (Table IV)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
